---
title: 'Bueni | Authentic Lagos Restaurant'
bodyClass: 'home loading'
---

{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------>
<!--------------------------------------- PAGE 1 / HERO-SECTION ---------------------------------------------->
<!------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------>

<section class="cmp-hero-section" aria-labelledby="main-hero-heading">
  <div class="wrapper cmp-hero-section-wrapper">

    <img class="hero-business-full-logo" src="/assets/logos/business-full-logo.webp" alt="Bueni's full logo" class="hero-section__image">

  </div>
</section>

<!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------->
<!--------------------------------------- PAGE 1 / SECTION-ONE / INTRODUCTION ------------------------------------>
<!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------->

<section class="cmp-light-section intro-section transition-reverse-slide" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">
  <div class="wrapper wrapper--mobile-s">

    <div class="intro-container" data-animate-group data-animate-start="top 45%">
      <div class="intro__text-container" data-animate="fade-in">
        <h2 id="intro-heading" class="cmp-main-heading">Where innovation meets tradition</h2>
        <p class="cmp-main-text cmp-main-text-margins">At the heart of every dish is a respect for time-honored techniques, paired with a curiosity for new ideas. Our kitchen draws inspiration from the past while embracing fresh influences, bringing together classic foundations and thoughtful creativity. Each plate is crafted with care, resulting in food that feels familiar, refined, and quietly distinctive.</p>
        <div class="intro__text-container__button">
          <a href="/about" class="cmp-secondary-btn">Our history</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-image-container">
        <img src="/assets/images/bueni-3.jpg" alt="foood" data-animate="slide-left">
        <img src="/assets/images/bueni-4.jpg" alt="foood" data-animate="slide-up">
        <img src="/assets/images/bueni-2.jpg" alt="foood" data-animate="slide-right">
      </div>
      <p class="cmp-main-text" data-animate="fade-in">We cook with intention, letting tradition set the pace while modern influences guide the direction. Time-tested methods form the foundation, while contemporary influences add nuance and depth. The result is food that feels familiar yet surprising, crafted to be enjoyed slowly and remembered long after.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------>
<!--------------------------------------- PAGE 1 / SECTION-THREE / GALLERY ----------------------------------->
<!------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------>

<section class="cmp-light-section transition-reverse-slide" aria-labelledby="gallery-heading">
  <div class="wrapper wrapper--mobile-s">

    <div class="gallery-section-container">
      <div class="gallery-text-container" data-animate="scale-size">
        <h2 id="gallery-heading" class="cmp-main-heading">Moments shared together</h2>
        <p class="cmp-main-text cmp-main-text-margins">A look inside the space, and the details that shape the food and experience. Our gallery captures the atmosphere of the restaurant and our dishes, as they are meant to be enjoyed, offering a sense of the setting and the moments shared around the table.</p>
        <a class="cmp-secondary-btn" href="/gallery">Gallery</a>
      </div>

      <div class="gallery-grid-container" data-animate-group>
        <img src="/assets/images/bueni-14.jpg" alt="Some food." data-animate="slide-down">
        <img src="/assets/images/bueni-10.jpg" alt="Some food." data-animate="slide-right">
        <img src="/assets/images/bueni-18.jpg" alt="Some food." data-animate="slide-left">
        <img src="/assets/images/bueni-16.jpg" alt="Some food." data-animate="slide-up">
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}